Release-Date: August 25, 2010

----

Changes:

* The "slb" module has been extended to support IPv6 SLB in multiple
legged, non DSR mode.

* The "rt" module has been added to allow IPv4 and IPv6 routing if
present at the end of the module chain (the parameter "ipforwarding"
needs to be set as before).

